WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.388 --> 00:00:03.954
Unit sixteen. Antibiotic Resistance!

2
00:00:04.926 --> 00:00:09.416
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.466 --> 00:00:12.455
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.505 --> 00:00:16.674
Today we learn about Antibiotic Resistance. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:22.670
Antibiotics. Say it with me. Antibiotics!

6
00:00:26.145 --> 00:00:30.295
Bacteria. Say it with me. Bacteria!

7
00:00:33.804 --> 00:00:38.137
Resistance. Say it with me. Resistance!

8
00:00:41.611 --> 00:00:45.411
Virus. Say it with me. Virus!

9
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.194
Prescription. Say it with me. Prescription!

10
00:00:56.664 --> 00:01:00.797
Full course. Say it with me. Full course!

11
00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:08.530
Superbugs. Say it with me. Superbugs!

12
00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:15.663
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

13
00:01:19.199 --> 00:01:33.654
Antibiotics treat bacteria, not a virus. Misuse helps bacteria develop resistance, creating superbugs. Use antibiotics only with a prescription, follow the instructions, and practise hygiene.

14
00:01:33.704 --> 00:01:37.133
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:37.835 --> 00:01:43.112
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.162 --> 00:01:44.384
Resistance!

17
00:01:45.669 --> 00:01:50.904
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.954 --> 00:01:52.143
Superbugs!

19
00:01:53.414 --> 00:02:00.581
Did you know? The WHO calls antimicrobial resistance one of the top global public health threats!

20
00:02:00.631 --> 00:02:03.089
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.139 --> 00:02:13.128
Think and answer. Why should antibiotics not be used for colds?

22
00:02:13.178 --> 00:02:14.391
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.278 --> 00:02:20.167
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:20.217 --> 00:02:22.843
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

